OL,3,GNEWSALong delays after M6 overnight
OL,4,Aroadworks overrun
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers have been facing delays of up
OL,7,Fto an an hour on a section of the M6
OL,8,Fthat remained shut after overnight
OL,9,Froadworks overran, National Highways
OL,10,F(NH) said.
OL,12,FThe northbound stretch in Staffordshire
OL,13,Fbetween junction 11 for Shareshill,
OL,14,Fnorth of Wolverhampton, and junction 12
OL,15,Ffor Gailey was closed, leading to
OL,16,Fseven-mile tailbacks.
OL,18,FProblems were caused because of issues
OL,19,Fwith tarmac supply and broken down
OL,20,Fmachinery, NH said.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
