OL,3,GNEWSALong delays after M6 overnight
OL,4,Aroadworks overrun
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt about 09:30 BST, NH said the road
OL,7,Fhad been cleared and reopened, but
OL,8,Fwarned motorists that the tailbacks
OL,9,Fwere continuing.
